{"doc_id":"RULE-POST-DISP-001","doc_type":"verification_rule","title":"后处理：最大位移上限","content":"当案例设置最大允许位移时，比较ODB提取的最大位移与限值。","domain":"verification","analysis_types":["linear_static"],"tags":["后处理","位移"],"status":"approved","evidence_level":"internal","sources":[],"rule":{"rule_id":"POST-DISP-001","name":"最大位移满足要求","description":"检查最大位移是否超过设计限值。","stage":"post","analysis_types":["linear_static"],"evaluator":"upper_bound","severity":"block","config":{"value_path":"evidence.max_displacement","limit_path":"case.acceptance.max_displacement","skip_if_missing":["case.acceptance.max_displacement"]},"enabled":true},"metadata":{"seed":true}}
{"doc_id":"RULE-POST-SF-001","doc_type":"verification_rule","title":"后处理：屈服安全系数","content":"当案例设置最低安全系数时，以材料屈服强度除以最大等效应力并与最低要求比较。","domain":"verification","analysis_types":["linear_static"],"tags":["后处理","应力","安全系数"],"status":"approved","evidence_level":"internal","sources":[],"rule":{"rule_id":"POST-SF-001","name":"屈服安全系数满足要求","description":"检查屈服强度与最大等效应力的比值。","stage":"post","analysis_types":["linear_static"],"evaluator":"ratio_min","severity":"block","config":{"numerator_path":"case.material.yield_strength","denominator_path":"evidence.max_equivalent_stress","minimum_path":"case.acceptance.min_safety_factor","skip_if_missing":["case.acceptance.min_safety_factor"]},"enabled":true},"metadata":{"seed":true}}
